								active listings).
								&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
								Set Include to true to return the default response set.
							</xs:documentation>
							<xs:appinfo>
								<CallInfo>
									<CallName>GetMyeBaySelling</CallName>
									<RequiredInput>No</RequiredInput>
								</CallInfo>
							</xs:appinfo>
						</xs:annotation>
