				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:enumeration>
			<xs:enumeration value="Discount">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>
						PowerSeller, PowerSeller shipping, Top-rated seller,
						eBay Stores subscription, or other subscription discount against the
