				 Call GetCategory2CS to determine valid characteristics set IDs.
				 Not applicable to Half.com.
				</xs:documentation>
				<xs:appinfo>
					<DeprecationVersion>773</DeprecationVersion>
					<DeprecationDetails>NoOp</DeprecationDetails>
