						MyMessages, OutBid, SecondChanceOffer, UPIBuyerResponseDispute, UPISellerClosedDispute,
						UPISellerOpenedDispute, and UPISellerRespondedToDispute.
					</xs:documentation>
					<xs:appinfo>
						<CallInfo>
