						This value is only applicable to DE/AT sellers subject to the new eBay payment
						process.
					</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:enumeration>		
			<xs:enumeration value="CustomCode">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>
						This value is reserved for internal or future use.
					</xs:documentation>
