						this value. If you estimate the number of pages yourself by using
						TotalProducts, EntriesPerPage, and MaxChildrenPerFamily (which is also an
						approximate value), your result will not necessarily match
						ApproximatePages.
					</xs:documentation>
					<xs:appinfo>
					<NoCalls/>
<!--
